    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910390/extras/2f05b43b5f293dde3cf555da2ed41929.avif?t=1748297354\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Raging Ball</i> is a challenging <strong>climbing game</strong> in which you control a bouncing ball and try to reach the top of different maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910390/extras/520b06e2e0e8b2905853305b9cd3a3d1.avif?t=1748297354\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 input</strong> only to control your character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5</strong> unique hand-crafted <strong>maps</strong> to climb, each one with new quircks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very <strong>satisfying movement</strong> system that rewards perseverance, endurance and skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30</strong> unlockable <strong>skins</strong> for your ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No death... but probably many <i>loooong</i> falls :C</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910390/extras/2f05b43b5f293dde3cf555da2ed41929.avif?t=1748297354\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Raging Ball</i> is a challenging <strong>climbing game</strong> in which you control a bouncing ball and try to reach the top of different maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910390/extras/520b06e2e0e8b2905853305b9cd3a3d1.avif?t=1748297354\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 input</strong> only to control your character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5</strong> unique hand-crafted <strong>maps</strong> to climb, each one with new quircks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very <strong>satisfying movement</strong> system that rewards perseverance, endurance and skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30</strong> unlockable <strong>skins</strong> for your ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No death... but probably many <i>loooong</i> falls :C</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Raging Ball is a challenging climbing game in which you control a bouncing ball. Bounce your way through challenging maps and try to reach the top of the world without ragi- ehm falling! You can (probably) do it!",
